OL,3,GNEWSAHome Office calls for restaurant
OL,4,Ato lose licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office is calling on a council
OL,7,Fto revoke a Turkish restaurant's
OL,8,Flicence after a man was found to be
OL,9,Fworking there illegally.
OL,11,FThe Home Office said that when
OL,12,FImmigration Compliance and Enforcement
OL,13,F(ICE) officers raided Yakamoz, on
OL,14,FGoodramgate in York, in September 2025,
OL,15,Fthe man initially claimed he was there
OL,16,Ffor a cup of tea.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
