OL,3,GNEWSAHome Office calls for restaurant
OL,4,Ato lose licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA licence review application, which
OL,7,Fwill go before City of York Council
OL,8,Fnext week, said: "Whether by negligence
OL,9,For willful blindness, illegal workers
OL,10,Fwere engaged in activity on the
OL,11,Fpremises."
OL,13,FIt said a #45,000 penalty handed to the
OL,14,Frestaurant remained unpaid.
